 "replace": true,
 "note": "Traced over the lidar relief (Oregon DOGAMI), where the campground lane shows plainly under the firs as a long narrow one-way loop: a crowned band with a ditch on its east side running north from the forest road past 01 to 09, round the end by 14 and back south-east, about 8 to 15 m apart. The Forest Service line ran along the ditch, 5 to 9 m east of the lane, and its north end was a box; replaced it, and re-drew the forest road along its band. Left out: lanes west to 10 to 13, which don't show."
